menu "DP8382x P4 example"
    config DP8382X_BOARD_READY
        bool "Allow this confirmed and powered board to run Ethernet"
        default n
        help
            Enable only after checking the final netlist, supplying PHY 3V3,
            confirming PHY address 0, 25 MHz oscillator, 50 MHz RMII clock,
            reset waveform and all required power rails on the actual board.
            The default image only reports its configuration and does not
            touch MAC, MDIO, reset GPIO or the network.
endmenu
